<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{if .Infected}}Infected file deleted{{else}}File withheld{{end}}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;">
<div role="main" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;">
<h1 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">{{.TenantName}}</h1>
<p>Hello,</p>
{{- if .Infected}}
<p>The antivirus found a threat in the following files of your transfer. They have been deleted.</p>
<ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">
{{- range .Infected}}
<li style="margin:0 0 12px;"><strong style="word-break:break-all;">{{.Name}}</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:14px;">Detected threat: <code style="font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;word-break:break-all;">{{.Signature}}</code></span></li>
{{- end}}
</ul>
{{- end}}
{{- if .Withheld}}
<p>The following files could not be analyzed by the antivirus and are withheld for safety: they cannot be downloaded.</p>
<ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">
{{- range .Withheld}}
<li style="margin:0 0 12px;"><strong style="word-break:break-all;">{{.Name}}</strong> ({{size .Size}})</li>
{{- end}}
</ul>
{{- end}}
<p><strong>{{if .Rejected}}No file of the transfer could be delivered: the transfer was not sent and the recipients have not been notified.{{else}}The other files of the transfer have been sent to the recipients.{{end}}</strong></p>
{{- if .Infected}}
<p>Check the device the files come from with an up-to-date antivirus before sending them again.</p>
{{- end}}
{{- if .Withheld}}
<p>To share a withheld file, send it again in a new transfer.</p>
{{- end}}
<hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #767676;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#4a4a4a;">{{t "mail.footer.automated" "tenant" .TenantName}}</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
